Python List Pop and Append

This project is a simple Python exercise for learning how to use the "pop()" and "append()" methods with Lists.

The program first removes an element from the list using "pop()" and then adds a new value to the end of the list using "append()".

Topics Covered

- Creating a List in Python
- Using "pop()" to remove an element
- Using "append()" to add an element
- Modifying list elements
- Using "print()" to display the result

Project Goal

The goal of this exercise is to understand how to remove and add elements to a Python list.

Language: Python 🐍
